\n\nコミッションを受け入れてくれてありがとう。あなたのロボットはかわいいです。^^", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@BeginningNB/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5200adb7/uploads/origins/3a10b70a-588a-41cd-8699-57a544ec5412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2226c44606e69028c46a19aace241f61", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5200adb7/uploads/origins/3a10b70a-588a-41cd-8699-57a544ec5412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2226c44606e69028c46a19aace241f61, https://si.imgix.net/5200adb7/uploads/origins/3a10b70a-588a-41cd-8699-57a544ec5412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=329d84d038c774bc0d92f375fedf666e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5200adb7/uploads/origins/3a10b70a-588a-41cd-8699-57a544ec5412?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=127c6374620032f0b709bc9a0628b4d5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、NatsuBerryです！AQUAとRumiaをかわいいキーホルダー風に描いてくれませんか？Like this: https://x.com/BeginningNB/status/1859617940590457266?t=j61mLn3ZM5ZytISXI0cIpQ&s=19\n\nAQUA: https://x.com/BeginningNB/status/1764671168769101827?t=mygT7MWgq4noqO8Dm0koLQ&s=19\nRumia: https://x.com/BeginningNB/status/1819033092046422095?t=RWXOD6P4S871KukoTBhShg&s=19", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@BeginningNB/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/039fd45d/uploads/origins/36b29237-5b02-488b-af2c-3a46abb9eb07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=556ee48df8d15dc134521127acda696f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/039fd45d/uploads/origins/36b29237-5b02-488b-af2c-3a46abb9eb07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=556ee48df8d15dc134521127acda696f, https://si.imgix.net/039fd45d/uploads/origins/36b29237-5b02-488b-af2c-3a46abb9eb07?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec1533bc54b28fdda79930f828888e3a 2